linuxmuster-radius (0.1.0) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * First release: the complete linuxmuster-radius delivery (P0-P6).
  * Data-plane image: FreeRADIUS 3.2 on Ubuntu 24.04 joining Samba AD as a
    member (winbind), PEAP-MSCHAPv2 via ntlm_auth, per-SSID gating, tini as
    PID 1, healthcheck (wbinfo -t + radclient status probe), read-only rootfs.
  * Control plane: FastAPI REST API + Typer CLI (thin client), git-backed YAML
    store, reconciler, digest-pinned health-gated updater, rendered clients.conf
    and ssid-policy per instance.
  * Dedicated single-purpose EAP-CA: `lmnradius ca init`, `cert issue`,
    `ca export`, `ca show`, `cert show`.
  * Deployment docs: AD member setup, UniFi/OPNsense, client trust via GPO/MDM;
    scripts discover-ad-facts.sh and provision-radius-account.sh.
  * Packaging: .deb with a hermetic venv under /opt/linuxmuster-radius/venv and
    a hardened systemd unit; CI (ci.yml, build-image.yml, build-deb.yml).
  * crabbox E2E harness: Samba AD DC + joined FreeRADIUS + eapol_test
    supplicant, 5-case PEAP matrix.

